## Attributes Reference

### `clients`

| Name | Type | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `id` | number | Numeric Portainer ID of the client. |
| `client_id` | string | OAuth client ID. |
| `name` | string | Name of the client. |
| `description` | string | Description of the client. |
| `homepage_url` | string | URL the launcher opens. |
| `permission` | string | `none`, `read-only` or `act-as-user`. |
| `all_users` | bool | Whether every user may sign in. |
| `enabled` | bool | Whether the client is switched on. |
| `groups_claim` | bool | Whether tokens carry the user's team names as `groups`. |
| `show_in_launcher` | bool | Whether the client is listed in the launcher. |
| `redirect_uris` | list(string) | Allowed redirect URIs. |
| `post_logout_redirect_uris` | list(string) | Allowed post-logout redirect URIs. |
| `user_access_policies` | map(number) | User IDs to role IDs. |
| `team_access_policies` | map(number) | Team IDs to role IDs. |
| `secrets` | list(object) | The client's secrets without their values: `id`, `description`, `hint`, `created_at`, `expires_at` (Unix times, 0 for never). |
